    "changelog": "Battle Mode ⚔\n• Two singers, one song, one turn each. The higher score wins.\n• Type in both singers' names (they're remembered next time).\n• A \"you're up!\" screen appears before each turn so nobody is caught off guard.\n• Result screen shows the winner, the point margin, and each singer's Perfect / Good / Miss / Max combo.\n• Draws are handled, so you can just sing again.\n• Series tracker keeps the win count between the two singers.\n• Rematch swaps who sings first. You can also start Battle with a new random song.\n• Open it from the Guess Song hub.\n\nPitch guide and mic\n• Fixed wrong octave showing on the pitch bar. Octave jumps are filtered out, while real octave leaps are still followed.\n• Mic now picks up your voice better and the backing song less. Echo cancellation and noise suppression are enabled, plus a smarter noise gate that learns the room and speaker level.\n• Pitch bar lanes now follow the key shift, so notes and your pitch dot stay in the right place when transposed.\n\nRecording\n• Fixed your voice missing from saved recordings when Live Mic is ON. If the live mic channel is silent, the app automatically falls back to the mic so your voice is always in the recording.",
